WEBVTT

00:07.040 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.080 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

02:00.080 --> 02:01.640
Greetings, Noble Lady Wu'an.

02:02.720 --> 02:05.240
Lord Lu came about an old case

02:05.320 --> 02:06.560
and visited
the Court of Justice late at night.

02:07.240 --> 02:10.000
I made an exception and pulled
the case files from 16 years ago.

02:13.320 --> 02:14.160
What case?

02:15.120 --> 02:16.920
Sixteen years ago,
during the Lantern Festival,

02:17.520 --> 02:19.320
the young daughter
of the Earl of Cheng'an's second branch,

02:19.920 --> 02:22.560
Wei Rao, was kidnapped and trafficked.

02:23.800 --> 02:26.920
Afterward, her wet nurse and guards
fled in fear of punishment.

02:27.520 --> 02:29.760
On their way to South Mountain,
bandits killed them.

02:30.280 --> 02:31.560
His Majesty was furious.

02:31.640 --> 02:33.600
He ordered the Court of Justice
to handle the case.

02:34.200 --> 02:35.480
He also sent troops
to search the entire city,

02:36.120 --> 02:37.400
but there was no news.

02:37.480 --> 02:38.720
Not until May the following year,

02:38.800 --> 02:40.160
when the Wei family

02:40.840 --> 02:42.680
found the girl at a market
after she'd been missing for a year.

02:45.960 --> 02:47.440
What was she wearing

02:48.440 --> 02:49.720
the day she was kidnapped?

02:50.240 --> 02:51.640
At the time,

02:51.720 --> 02:53.920
Lady Wei Rao was barely two.

02:54.000 --> 02:56.680
She wore a crimson brocade robe
with cloud patterns,

02:57.240 --> 03:00.920
a white fox cloak,
and little white silk socks,

03:01.000 --> 03:02.800
with red silk shoes with upturned toes.

03:02.880 --> 03:06.080
She wore a gold-and-jade Longevity Lock,

03:06.160 --> 03:07.840
engraved with "Long Life"

03:07.920 --> 03:09.880
and "Endless Blessings".

03:09.960 --> 03:11.000
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

03:15.840 --> 03:17.560
This is the one.

03:18.520 --> 03:20.800
Then who is
the Lady Wei Rao at Xianzhuang?

03:22.280 --> 03:24.320
How could something
so bizarre and horrifying happen?

03:40.440 --> 03:42.840
Who are you?
Why are you sneaking around out there?

03:42.920 --> 03:45.120
Spare me, My Lord. Your Ladyship.

03:45.720 --> 03:48.200
I thought this courtyard was abandoned,

03:48.280 --> 03:50.160
so I came looking for valuables.

03:50.760 --> 03:51.920
So you're a thief!

03:52.760 --> 03:54.480
You recognized him as Lord Lu at once,

03:54.560 --> 03:55.760
and I as Noble Lady Wu'an.

03:56.440 --> 03:58.080
You're clearly no common thief.

03:58.160 --> 03:59.600
Much appreciated, sir.

03:59.680 --> 04:00.880
Please take him
back to the Court of Justice

04:00.960 --> 04:02.280
and question him thoroughly.

04:02.360 --> 04:03.840
No need to ask, Your Ladyship.

04:03.920 --> 04:05.120
The Court of Justice

04:05.200 --> 04:07.240
has plenty of ways
to deal with petty thieves.

04:07.880 --> 04:09.720
Your Ladyship, forgive me! Please!

04:10.400 --> 04:12.800
I lied! I'm not a thief!

04:12.880 --> 04:14.640
I-I-I'm…

04:19.200 --> 04:20.600
Escort the Deputy Justice out.

04:21.200 --> 04:23.280
Everyone else, wait outside the courtyard.

04:24.000 --> 04:24.840
Yes.

04:40.880 --> 04:43.720
Your Ladyship, my name is Lv Lun.

04:43.800 --> 04:45.720
I'm a steward
at the Earl of Cheng'an's estate.

04:45.800 --> 04:49.160
My wife is surnamed Chang.
She once served Lady Guo.

04:49.240 --> 04:51.520
Three days ago,
my wife fled the residence,

04:51.600 --> 04:54.440
but someone murdered her.

04:54.520 --> 04:55.720
Who killed her?

04:55.800 --> 04:58.680
The fake Lady Wei Rao at Xianzhuang!

05:02.520 --> 05:03.760
How do you know she's an impostor?

05:03.840 --> 05:07.320
My wife discovered
the truth about her identity,

05:07.400 --> 05:08.720
and was killed and silenced.

05:09.520 --> 05:13.040
I also know
what really happened back then.

05:13.120 --> 05:15.080
Rather than live in fear every night,

05:15.160 --> 05:16.640
waiting to be murdered,

05:16.720 --> 05:19.400
I chose to risk
coming to you, Your Ladyship.

05:19.480 --> 05:21.640
I only hope this can atone for my crimes

05:21.720 --> 05:23.560
and spare my life, Your Ladyship!

05:24.200 --> 05:25.960
Tell me everything you know.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.440
Leave nothing out.

05:27.520 --> 05:29.280
If you lie about a single word,

05:29.920 --> 05:31.360
I'll break every bone
in your body, one by one!

05:32.160 --> 05:35.560
I wouldn't dare! Every word I say is true.

05:35.640 --> 05:37.000
It was Wei Heng'e.

05:37.080 --> 05:38.600
She hated Second Madam Zhou…

05:38.680 --> 05:42.360
No. She hated Lady Li for abandoning
her daughter and remarrying.

05:42.440 --> 05:44.720
She bribed the wet nurse and guards

05:44.800 --> 05:46.680
to deliberately abandon Lady Wei Rao.

05:46.760 --> 05:49.240
My wife saw it all herself.

05:49.320 --> 05:50.640
Over a year later,

05:50.720 --> 05:52.400
Lady Li couldn't bear losing her daughter.

05:52.480 --> 05:53.920
She kept searching everywhere.

05:54.000 --> 05:56.760
To keep His Majesty from blaming
the Earl of Cheng'an's family,

05:56.840 --> 05:58.240
Wei Heng'e came up
with another vicious plan.

05:58.320 --> 06:00.560
She found a girl
of similar age and appearance

06:00.640 --> 06:03.040
to take Lady Wei Rao's place.

06:03.120 --> 06:05.680
Your Ladyship, I can testify

06:05.760 --> 06:07.480
that the Wei Rao
at Xianzhuang is an impostor.

06:07.560 --> 06:09.160
You, Your Ladyship,

06:09.240 --> 06:12.320
are the true daughter
of the Earl's family.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.120
We have both witnesses and evidence.

06:20.960 --> 06:22.280
What's on your mind?

06:23.760 --> 06:24.600
No.

06:26.800 --> 06:28.240
No, something's wrong.

06:29.480 --> 06:32.320
There are still
too many things that don't add up.

06:34.760 --> 06:38.080
Finding two young girls
who look nearly identical

06:38.160 --> 06:40.200
and are about the same age is hard enough.

06:41.880 --> 06:43.400
Yet all these years,

06:44.240 --> 06:47.240
Wei Heng'e has treasured her brother's
only daughter.

06:47.840 --> 06:49.600
For this fake Wei Rao,

06:50.280 --> 06:51.280
she even found a substitute bride.

06:52.200 --> 06:53.720
That makes no sense at all.

06:54.800 --> 06:56.240
Jundai and I

06:57.200 --> 06:58.600
do look very much alike.

07:00.280 --> 07:01.840
Wei Heng'e and your birth father…

07:04.120 --> 07:05.400
were twins.

07:08.560 --> 07:10.400
-Jundai is her daughter.
-Jundai is her daughter.

07:15.680 --> 07:17.240
I'm going to
the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.400
I need to see Old Madam Wei.

07:20.280 --> 07:21.400
Right now.

07:22.480 --> 07:23.960
I know how to handle this.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.520
You should return to camp, My Lord.

07:25.600 --> 07:28.400
Don't let me delay matters of state.

07:32.000 --> 07:32.840
Zhao Song.

07:33.440 --> 07:35.960
Go with her to the Wei Residence.
Take more men with you.

07:36.600 --> 07:38.240
-Yes, My Lord.
-Zhao Bai.

07:38.760 --> 07:40.520
Pick 200 elite soldiers from the camp.

07:41.120 --> 07:42.880
-I have another use for them.
-Yes.

07:44.920 --> 07:47.320
-My Lord, that maid Bitao…
-Tell me on the way.

07:56.000 --> 07:57.120
Lady Li,

07:57.200 --> 07:59.400
the men sent to fetch Madam Qiao are back.

07:59.480 --> 08:01.560
They were ambushed on the way.

08:01.640 --> 08:04.560
Madam Qiao and the other two are missing.

08:08.920 --> 08:10.960
Who else would dare

08:11.040 --> 08:12.600
abduct them in broad daylight but her?

08:13.360 --> 08:16.560
So young, yet so brazen!

08:16.640 --> 08:18.720
Has the Empress Dowager's procession
left the palace?

08:18.800 --> 08:21.160
Don't worry, Lady Li. Aman went to check.

08:23.880 --> 08:24.720
Lady Li,

08:24.800 --> 08:26.680
the Empress Dowager's royal carriage
is already 20 miles outside the city.

08:26.760 --> 08:28.760
The Empress
and the other consorts went with her.

08:29.760 --> 08:30.680
Good.

08:31.640 --> 08:33.400
All that patience wasn't for nothing.

08:33.480 --> 08:35.039
I've finally lived to see this day.

08:35.679 --> 08:38.760
The Empress Dowager has gone
to the hot springs for treatment.

08:39.559 --> 08:42.280
Now I can cut out this rot
without holding back.

08:43.080 --> 08:44.880
By the time she returns to the capital,

08:44.960 --> 08:46.880
it'll all be over.

08:47.640 --> 08:50.320
Prepare the carriage.
I'm leaving the palace.

08:52.240 --> 08:53.120
-Yes.
-Yes, Your Ladyship.

09:04.840 --> 09:07.120
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

09:08.840 --> 09:12.160
Those two pretty girls
were just playthings to pass the time.

09:12.680 --> 09:14.360
Not worth upsetting Mother this much.

09:15.600 --> 09:17.360
I've already moved them
out of the residence.

09:17.440 --> 09:19.040
They're fragile ladies.

09:19.960 --> 09:21.080
Weak and delicate.

09:21.920 --> 09:24.280
Losing support all at once,

09:24.360 --> 09:26.920
they are bound to struggle to get by.

09:27.840 --> 09:29.200
I understand.

09:29.280 --> 09:30.120
GRACE OF AUTUMN, HEART OF VIRTUE

09:30.200 --> 09:32.480
As for their expenses,

09:32.560 --> 09:34.040
I'll find an excuse

09:35.120 --> 09:37.200
to pay them from the household account.

09:39.880 --> 09:43.600
With a wife like you,
what more could I ask for?

09:43.680 --> 09:45.080
It's simply my duty.

09:46.720 --> 09:47.560
Oh, right.

09:48.160 --> 09:51.280
Lady Chun had abdominal pain
for half the night last night.

09:51.360 --> 09:54.480
We called a physician,
but he couldn't find the cause.

09:55.960 --> 09:57.120
You should go check on her.

09:58.640 --> 10:00.320
She's always throwing tantrums.

10:01.520 --> 10:04.720
If everyone were as sensible
and understanding as you,

10:04.800 --> 10:06.600
I'd have far fewer headaches.

10:07.720 --> 10:09.400
Farewell, My Lord.

10:11.240 --> 10:12.800
I'll go see her.

10:16.680 --> 10:17.520
My back…

10:18.160 --> 10:19.640
This is really getting in the way.

10:22.120 --> 10:23.160
Brother.

10:23.240 --> 10:25.560
Can't you see
your brother can barely move?

10:26.160 --> 10:28.560
You're a grown woman.
How can you still be so reckless and rude?

10:29.160 --> 10:30.120
Rude.

10:35.800 --> 10:38.880
Yufeng, save me! Yufeng, please save me!

10:39.600 --> 10:41.880
Get up first. Come on.

10:47.240 --> 10:48.120
You may leave.

10:48.200 --> 10:49.320
Yes.

10:53.560 --> 10:56.920
Yufeng, I just saw Noble Lady Wu'an.

10:57.000 --> 10:58.560
She brought a man here under guard.

10:58.640 --> 10:59.800
I sent men to find out why.

10:59.880 --> 11:01.880
She actually has a witness and evidence

11:01.960 --> 11:04.280
proving she's the real Wei Rao.

11:04.360 --> 11:06.440
I'd had my suspicions before.

11:06.520 --> 11:07.840
After all, she looks…

11:07.920 --> 11:10.040
But strange things happen in this world.

11:10.120 --> 11:12.120
Two people looking alike
isn't that unusual.

11:12.880 --> 11:14.240
Besides, back then,

11:14.760 --> 11:17.600
that child was clearly dead.

11:18.480 --> 11:19.840
She's dead!

11:19.920 --> 11:21.880
We all saw it with our own eyes.

11:23.360 --> 11:25.960
Could it be

11:26.040 --> 11:28.280
that the dead
really can come back to life?

11:29.480 --> 11:32.720
Yufeng… She's really back.

11:32.800 --> 11:35.120
She's come back! You have to help me.

11:35.200 --> 11:37.560
If you refuse to save me now,

11:37.640 --> 11:40.560
a truly catastrophic disaster awaits us!

11:42.760 --> 11:45.560
There's always a way out. Don't panic.

11:47.280 --> 11:48.160
But she…

11:49.520 --> 11:52.240
Zhou Fu and I
were sisters-in-law for years.

11:52.320 --> 11:54.080
I know her better than anyone.

11:54.160 --> 11:56.360
She's clever.

11:57.080 --> 11:59.560
Too clever for her own good.

12:00.160 --> 12:02.000
People who are proud

12:02.600 --> 12:04.560
and strong-willed

12:05.080 --> 12:09.600
are often stubborn
and determined to have their own way.

12:10.240 --> 12:12.120
All these years in the palace,

12:12.200 --> 12:16.240
she's lived in luxury,
above everyone else.

12:16.320 --> 12:18.600
Now she can't stand anyone defying her.

12:18.680 --> 12:20.560
‎GRACE OF AUTUMN, HEART OF VIRTUE

12:20.640 --> 12:24.000
Use that weakness to your advantage.

12:26.240 --> 12:27.640
It's just…

12:27.720 --> 12:30.240
Yufeng, you have another way?

12:30.960 --> 12:32.880
It's a vicious plan.

12:32.960 --> 12:34.680
It may bring bad karma.

12:34.760 --> 12:36.600
Forget it. Pretend I said nothing.

12:36.680 --> 12:37.520
Hey…

12:38.040 --> 12:40.440
Yufeng, I'll do whatever you say.

12:40.520 --> 12:42.560
As long as you can save me,

12:42.640 --> 12:44.000
I'll give you anything you want.

12:44.680 --> 12:47.560
-Yufeng…
-No. We really can't.

12:47.640 --> 12:49.720
Yufeng, we're out of time!

12:50.520 --> 12:52.160
Just tell me what to do.

12:52.760 --> 12:54.560
Works or not,
I'll take full responsibility.

12:54.640 --> 12:56.680
I won't drag you into this.

12:56.760 --> 12:59.080
And for the rest of my life,

12:59.160 --> 13:01.560
I'll never forget what you've done for me.

13:05.360 --> 13:07.040
Since it's come to this,

13:08.000 --> 13:09.440
we might as well try.

13:10.320 --> 13:12.720
Whether it works is up to fate.

13:55.560 --> 13:56.400
Who's there?

13:56.480 --> 13:58.160
It's me, Grandmother.

14:02.240 --> 14:04.040
You're sick too.

14:04.120 --> 14:07.320
Didn't the physician tell you
to get plenty of rest?

14:08.360 --> 14:10.440
I don't need you tending to me.

14:10.520 --> 14:12.240
Go back and rest.

14:12.320 --> 14:14.040
I've been confined
to the Wei family since childhood,

14:14.120 --> 14:15.840
so I never had the chance
to be close to you.

14:15.920 --> 14:17.440
Now that I finally have this chance,

14:17.520 --> 14:20.120
I only wish to stay
by your side every day.

14:20.200 --> 14:22.920
How could caring for you ever be a burden?

14:25.960 --> 14:27.400
Grandmother, you don't look well.

14:30.880 --> 14:33.160
At my age…

14:34.040 --> 14:36.080
A few aches and fevers are inevitable.

14:36.160 --> 14:40.200
But today, for some reason,
I feel especially drowsy.

14:40.920 --> 14:43.000
I have no strength at all.

14:46.800 --> 14:50.080
Perhaps you've caught a chill.
We shouldn't take it lightly.

14:50.600 --> 14:53.280
Lie down and rest, Grandmother.
I'll fetch the physician.

14:53.880 --> 14:54.840
All right.

15:03.440 --> 15:04.760
Take good care of her.

15:05.400 --> 15:06.360
-Yes.
-Yes.

15:20.720 --> 15:21.720
Go tell Grandmother I'm here.

15:21.800 --> 15:22.800
I have matters to discuss.

15:22.880 --> 15:24.800
Young Master, Old Madam has taken a chill.

15:24.880 --> 15:26.480
She suffers from headache and fever,
and has remained in a deep sleep.

15:27.080 --> 15:28.360
I didn't dare disturb her.

15:29.280 --> 15:30.600
That's strange.

15:30.680 --> 15:31.840
She's always been in excellent health.

15:32.440 --> 15:34.720
She climbed the whole mountain
at Double Ninth without stopping.

15:34.800 --> 15:36.440
How did she suddenly fall ill?

15:37.920 --> 15:38.760
Has a physician seen her?

15:39.360 --> 15:40.600
The physician took her pulse.

15:40.680 --> 15:43.080
He said a chill
had weakened her vital energy.

15:43.160 --> 15:45.000
He prescribed Cinnamon Twig Decoction
to dispel the chill.

15:46.760 --> 15:47.760
Then I'll come back later.

15:52.160 --> 15:53.000
Has Wei Rao been here?

15:53.640 --> 15:54.600
Yes, Young Master.

15:54.680 --> 15:56.920
Physician Wang first wanted
to prescribe Ephedra Decoction.

15:57.000 --> 15:58.480
Young Lady called him
an incompetent old fool.

15:58.560 --> 16:00.440
She said sweating
is in need of Cinnamon Twig Decoction.

16:00.520 --> 16:02.920
Then Physicians Li and Zhang
confirmed the diagnosis

16:03.000 --> 16:04.640
before Old Madam took the medicine.

16:04.720 --> 16:07.560
Young Lady stayed with Old Madam
until she'd taken her medicine.

16:08.600 --> 16:09.560
She's certainly attentive.

16:10.720 --> 16:13.000
-Tell me as soon as Grandmother wakes.
-Yes.

16:13.080 --> 16:17.320
HERON LODGE

16:18.000 --> 16:21.760
Aunt Heng'e, I've cleared
every obstacle from your path.

16:21.840 --> 16:24.000
Don't disappoint me.

16:31.640 --> 16:35.040
Lu Zhuo. I won't let you
ruin my plans again today.

16:36.040 --> 16:38.800
It's time to end this once and for all.

16:39.400 --> 16:41.440
Wait!

16:42.040 --> 16:44.440
Lady Li!

16:44.520 --> 16:47.040
Make way for Lady Li! Anyone blocking
her procession gets 100 lashes!

16:47.120 --> 16:48.240
Lower your head!

16:48.320 --> 16:49.400
Lady Li.

16:49.480 --> 16:51.880
Someone from the Earl of Cheng'an's family
seeks an audience.

16:51.960 --> 16:54.840
Lady Li!
I have something urgent to report.

16:54.920 --> 16:57.560
I'm from the Wei family. I'm Wei Heng'e!

16:58.440 --> 17:00.080
So it really is an old acquaintance.

17:01.080 --> 17:02.320
It's been 16 years.

17:02.920 --> 17:04.800
It truly has been a long time.

17:05.560 --> 17:06.440
Let her through.

17:11.520 --> 17:14.720
Wei Heng'e greets Lady Li.

17:14.800 --> 17:15.960
Wei Heng'e.

17:16.720 --> 17:20.079
I remember how
you always had a rule for everything.

17:20.720 --> 17:23.200
If a widowed sister-in-law
grieved too deeply,

17:23.720 --> 17:26.480
she was inconsiderate
to her elders and called unfilial.

17:27.680 --> 17:30.920
If she'd cried herself dry
and had no tears left,

17:31.000 --> 17:32.680
she was called heartless.

17:33.400 --> 17:35.040
If she consulted a male physician,

17:35.760 --> 17:38.480
you'd gossip behind her back

17:38.560 --> 17:40.800
and call her shameless.

17:41.480 --> 17:43.720
Clearly, you hold
proper conduct above all else.

17:43.800 --> 17:46.080
Then you should know

17:46.160 --> 17:48.520
the Imperial Family has its dignity.

17:48.600 --> 17:50.840
Anyone who disrupts a royal procession

17:51.560 --> 17:53.480
cannot be easily pardoned.

17:56.480 --> 17:58.160
Now I'd like to know

17:58.800 --> 18:00.680
what could be so important

18:01.280 --> 18:03.840
that you had to barge into my procession.

18:04.920 --> 18:07.880
If your reason isn't good enough,
you'll get 100 lashes.

18:08.680 --> 18:09.960
There's no getting out of that.

18:10.920 --> 18:12.200
Everything I did before

18:12.720 --> 18:14.600
was because I was blind and foolish.

18:15.120 --> 18:16.440
I offended you, Lady Li.

18:17.360 --> 18:18.960
I'll gladly take the lashes.

18:19.600 --> 18:21.760
I only ask for your mercy.

18:21.840 --> 18:24.720
But this concerns Noble Lady Wu'an.

18:25.360 --> 18:27.440
It concerns your own daughter.

18:27.520 --> 18:28.800
Please hear me out.

18:28.880 --> 18:32.520
For my late brother's sake,

18:32.600 --> 18:34.240
please grant me this favor.

18:44.320 --> 18:45.480
Let the Wei family come along.

18:48.640 --> 18:51.160
South Mountain isn't far from the capital.

18:52.280 --> 18:54.600
This close to the Emperor,
it should be peaceful.

18:55.120 --> 18:58.480
So why can't
these few bandits be wiped out?

18:59.560 --> 19:03.160
The bandits of South Mountain
have long plagued the court.

19:03.240 --> 19:05.040
His Majesty
has sent troops there many times,

19:05.120 --> 19:06.840
but the more we kill, the more appear.

19:06.920 --> 19:09.040
Traveling merchants are terrified of them.

19:09.560 --> 19:10.680
Here.

19:10.760 --> 19:12.000
The terrain there is treacherous.

19:12.080 --> 19:13.800
Easy to defend, hard to attack.

19:13.880 --> 19:15.320
The bandits are scattered
across the peaks.

19:15.400 --> 19:17.320
They hide by day and strike at night.

19:17.400 --> 19:18.800
When troops climb the mountain, they flee.

19:18.880 --> 19:20.800
We can barely find them,
much less wipe them out.

19:21.960 --> 19:23.680
But that's the Northern Army's problem.

19:23.760 --> 19:25.600
What does it have to do with you, Lord Lu?

19:25.680 --> 19:27.240
Why the sudden interest?

19:30.160 --> 19:31.760
My Lord, the troops are assembled.

19:31.840 --> 19:33.000
We're ready to set out.

19:33.640 --> 19:34.800
My Lord.

19:36.520 --> 19:38.120
My Lord, word just came from the palace.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.800
His Majesty is coming
to inspect the troops today.

19:39.880 --> 19:42.040
The Imperial procession
has already left Sima Gate.

19:43.920 --> 19:45.920
Put the entire army on high alert!

19:46.000 --> 19:47.440
Assemble all the generals.

19:47.520 --> 19:49.200
Come with me to prepare
the drill grounds at once!

19:52.320 --> 19:54.240
-No. Something's wrong.
-What is it?

19:54.840 --> 19:56.560
The grand review isn't due yet.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.920
the troops are caught unprepared.

19:58.440 --> 20:00.640
Inspecting troops
in peacetime breaks protocol.

20:01.240 --> 20:03.000
Why did His Majesty
suddenly change his mind?

20:03.640 --> 20:06.080
Something about this doesn't feel right.

20:06.720 --> 20:08.320
It is strange.

20:08.840 --> 20:10.360
But if His Majesty just got a whim,

20:10.440 --> 20:11.640
we just receive him.

20:11.720 --> 20:13.040
Don't overthink it.

20:13.120 --> 20:15.480
His Majesty moved the inspection up.

20:16.000 --> 20:17.320
Someone may have put him up to it.

20:18.880 --> 20:20.240
I have something urgent to handle.

20:20.760 --> 20:23.440
Shunqin. I'm leaving the camp to you.

20:24.360 --> 20:26.280
Find a way to stall the Imperial carriage.

20:29.320 --> 20:30.320
Hey you…

20:34.920 --> 20:36.320
Where are you going at a time like this?

20:36.400 --> 20:37.920
What am I supposed to tell His Majesty?

20:38.000 --> 20:40.680
Even His Majesty can't break protocol.

20:40.760 --> 20:42.840
Just say the camp's defenses aren't ready

20:42.920 --> 20:43.760
and His Majesty's safety could be at risk.

20:43.840 --> 20:46.720
Remember, get several censors to join you

20:46.800 --> 20:47.640
and do everything you can to stop him.

20:47.720 --> 20:49.160
Are you out of your mind?

20:49.680 --> 20:51.360
What could matter more than your life?

20:52.120 --> 20:53.920
You can't just halt
His Majesty's procession.

20:54.000 --> 20:56.280
No. You're not going anywhere.

20:56.360 --> 20:57.640
Whatever it is, it can wait.

20:58.320 --> 21:00.320
You're coming with me
to receive His Majesty!

21:00.400 --> 21:03.040
General Qi is right.
Please think this through, My Lord.

21:04.440 --> 21:06.680
I'm counting on you. Move out!

21:12.600 --> 21:14.840
ZHAO

21:15.480 --> 21:17.960
That fool. That absolute fool!

21:19.000 --> 21:20.400
I haven't even told him about Bitao yet.

21:20.480 --> 21:21.960
What happened to Bitao?

21:22.040 --> 21:24.320
N-Nothing.

21:24.400 --> 21:25.640
Maybe I'm just overthinking it.

21:26.520 --> 21:28.520
Who knows when His Lordship will be back?

21:31.880 --> 21:33.320
SOUTH MOUNTAIN BANDIT STRONGHOLD

21:33.400 --> 21:34.760
Top it up.

21:35.480 --> 21:36.680
Drink up.

21:37.280 --> 21:40.320
The soldiers are coming! The soldiers!

21:40.400 --> 21:41.880
Soldiers!

21:41.960 --> 21:43.640
The soldiers are coming!

21:43.720 --> 21:45.280
The soldiers are coming!

21:56.840 --> 21:57.680
Move!

22:00.000 --> 22:01.360
-Move!
-Hurry!

22:04.800 --> 22:05.680
Look closely.

22:06.640 --> 22:08.240
Do you recognize these two?

22:09.360 --> 22:12.400
No. No… I don't know them…

22:12.480 --> 22:13.320
Kill him.

22:14.560 --> 22:16.800
No! Wait! Wait! Spare me, General!

22:16.880 --> 22:18.680
I've truly never seen them!

22:19.320 --> 22:21.880
On South Mountain alone,
there are thirteen major strongholds.

22:21.960 --> 22:24.520
Their leaders are all ruthless killers.

22:24.600 --> 22:26.520
General, perhaps
you've got the wrong place.

22:27.200 --> 22:28.320
Thirteen?

22:29.240 --> 22:30.680
That's no problem.

22:31.480 --> 22:32.760
We'll wipe them out one by one.

22:32.840 --> 22:36.520
We'll leave heads rolling
and the mountains red with blood.

22:36.600 --> 22:39.200
Before dawn tomorrow, we'll find them.

22:40.280 --> 22:41.320
No, no, wait!

22:42.240 --> 22:44.160
I'll do whatever you ask, General!

22:44.240 --> 22:46.200
My patience is running thin.

22:46.920 --> 22:48.800
You'll lead the way
and get us through their gates.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.520
Before sunset,

22:51.360 --> 22:54.520
I want all thirteen heads.
Lined up neatly! Not one missing.

22:54.600 --> 22:56.160
At your command, General.

22:59.720 --> 23:00.760
XIANZHUANG

23:00.840 --> 23:02.520
Everything you just said

23:02.600 --> 23:04.200
is true?

23:04.280 --> 23:05.880
She harbored a runaway servant
from the Wei family

23:05.960 --> 23:08.360
and dug into Rao's disappearance
from years ago.

23:08.440 --> 23:10.240
Who knows what she's really plotting?

23:11.040 --> 23:13.320
Heaven and earth are my witnesses.

23:13.400 --> 23:15.760
I swear on my late brother.

23:15.840 --> 23:17.000
If a single word is false,

23:17.080 --> 23:20.200
may I meet a terrible end.

23:22.680 --> 23:24.240
This concerns Lady Li's beloved daughter.

23:24.320 --> 23:25.640
I dared not hide it from you.

23:26.160 --> 23:28.760
For the sake of your own flesh and blood,

23:29.440 --> 23:32.400
please judge this fairly
and give Rao justice.

23:34.920 --> 23:35.880
Lady Li.

23:35.960 --> 23:38.280
Old Madam Wei, Lady Guo,

23:38.360 --> 23:39.880
and Noble Lady Wu'an request an audience.

23:41.680 --> 23:42.600
Very well.

23:43.320 --> 23:44.920
Everyone who should be here is here.

23:45.520 --> 23:46.600
Let them in.

23:47.320 --> 23:48.240
Yes.

24:03.720 --> 24:06.560
Lady Li summons Old Madam Wei
and Noble Lady Wu'an.

24:13.640 --> 24:16.800
Rao, come inside with me.

24:49.440 --> 24:54.440
DWELLING IN TRUTH, DEEP IN THE WOODS

24:56.720 --> 24:57.720
No need for formalities.

24:58.840 --> 25:01.240
Old Madam Wei, have a seat.

25:09.440 --> 25:11.080
Your timing is perfect, Noble Lady Wu'an.

25:11.800 --> 25:13.280
Even if you hadn't come today,

25:13.360 --> 25:15.600
I would've sent for you.

25:16.760 --> 25:20.520
I trust you haven't forgotten my warning.

25:20.600 --> 25:24.080
-Lady Li…
-Whatever you wish to reprimand her for,

25:24.680 --> 25:28.600
wait until you've seen
the evidence she brought.

25:29.480 --> 25:31.160
Tell Lady Li

25:31.240 --> 25:34.440
exactly what you told me.

25:38.480 --> 25:40.960
Lady Li, A-Chou…

25:41.040 --> 25:43.120
No, Noble Lady Wu'an

25:43.640 --> 25:44.880
is not my biological daughter.

25:45.480 --> 25:47.040
Sixteen years ago,

25:47.120 --> 25:49.920
I found her under
an old cypress tree on the rear hill.

25:50.440 --> 25:51.480
My eldest daughter died young,

25:51.560 --> 25:53.200
so I took the risk

25:53.280 --> 25:55.160
of giving this child A-Chou's identity

25:55.240 --> 25:57.200
and raised her as my own poor daughter.

25:57.840 --> 26:00.040
I selfishly hid the truth from her.

26:00.640 --> 26:01.920
I deserve death for my crime.

26:02.920 --> 26:03.920
Please have mercy, Lady Li.

26:10.200 --> 26:12.000
You found her on the mountain?

26:12.800 --> 26:15.360
Yes. I found her there.

26:15.960 --> 26:17.240
On the night of the Lantern Festival,

26:17.320 --> 26:20.200
Wei Rao was abducted
and vanished without a trace.

26:21.360 --> 26:22.840
Someone clearly plotted to harm her

26:23.480 --> 26:25.720
and wanted her dead. Lv Lun.

26:28.000 --> 26:30.600
Lady Li, my wife, Madam Chang,

26:30.680 --> 26:32.440
served at the Wei Residence for years.

26:32.520 --> 26:35.280
She knew everything that happened there.

26:35.360 --> 26:38.320
One day, she happened to see her.
It was her!

26:39.080 --> 26:40.600
She bribed the wet nurse and guards

26:40.680 --> 26:43.200
and conspired with criminals
to kidnap and sell the young lady.

26:43.280 --> 26:45.840
Afterward, fearing she'd be executed,

26:45.920 --> 26:48.560
she cruelly abandoned
the young lady in the wilderness

26:48.640 --> 26:50.760
and left her to die!

26:51.280 --> 26:52.840
The night the young lady disappeared,

26:52.920 --> 26:55.240
-she was wearing crimson…
-You don't need to tell me that.

26:55.320 --> 26:58.400
The night Wei Rao disappeared,
the court posted notices everywhere.

26:58.480 --> 27:00.160
Everyone knew what she was wearing.

27:00.760 --> 27:02.720
A crimson brocade robe with cloud patterns

27:02.800 --> 27:05.120
under a white fox cloak.

27:05.200 --> 27:06.920
What? Did you find them?

27:07.520 --> 27:08.400
Of course.

27:09.640 --> 27:11.960
My adoptive mother hid them
under the stove for years.

27:12.040 --> 27:13.680
We only just found them.

27:14.960 --> 27:15.920
Bitao.

27:21.600 --> 27:23.120
Here's the evidence.

27:23.200 --> 27:24.360
One look and you'll know, Lady Li.

27:34.240 --> 27:35.440
Yinggu.

28:42.040 --> 28:43.720
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

29:04.360 --> 29:06.160
-This one's pretty.
-Pretty, isn't it?

29:06.240 --> 29:08.600
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

29:12.000 --> 29:13.680
All you know
is the gift for your daughter.

29:16.080 --> 29:16.920
Here.

29:21.240 --> 29:22.800
Here. I'll put it on you.

29:44.480 --> 29:47.000
Mother… I…

30:11.280 --> 30:13.760
That's right. Back then, Wei Jin

30:14.640 --> 30:17.160
personally engraved the Longevity Lock

30:17.840 --> 30:21.200
with "Long Life" and "Endless Blessings."

30:22.040 --> 30:23.840
But when Rao was born,

30:25.400 --> 30:27.600
I named her Mingzhu.

30:28.520 --> 30:30.440
My precious girl,

30:30.520 --> 30:32.400
cherished like a pearl in my palm.

30:33.200 --> 30:35.560
But fearing it would
diminish her blessings,

30:36.080 --> 30:37.400
I only dared to engrave tiny words

30:37.480 --> 30:39.920
on the back of the Longevity Lock…

30:40.720 --> 30:43.640
"To my beloved daughter, Mingzhu."

30:44.320 --> 30:48.040
Those tiny words
were never recorded in the case files,

30:48.120 --> 30:50.040
and very few people knew about them.

30:52.360 --> 30:54.480
But on the back of this Longevity Lock,

30:55.520 --> 30:57.000
there's nothing at all.

31:13.400 --> 31:14.440
How…

31:15.440 --> 31:16.520
How can that be?

31:21.720 --> 31:23.520
When I found Noble Lady Wu'an,

31:23.600 --> 31:25.480
she was wearing this very Longevity Lock.

31:26.120 --> 31:27.840
I knew it was tied to her true identity.

31:28.520 --> 31:30.680
I feared someone would discover it
and take my child away.

31:31.680 --> 31:33.840
We were poor, but I never dared sell it.

31:34.480 --> 31:35.680
This is the one.

31:38.040 --> 31:42.440
Lady Li, could there be some mistake?

31:43.160 --> 31:44.040
Mother,

31:44.120 --> 31:47.960
you raised Rao yourself
from the time she was little.

31:48.040 --> 31:50.240
There was never any doubt
about who she was.

31:50.840 --> 31:53.400
Now someone else has come to claim her,

31:53.480 --> 31:56.640
so the keepsake must match perfectly

31:56.720 --> 31:58.480
before anyone can believe it.

31:58.560 --> 32:01.400
Please stay calm.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.520
Let Lady Li

32:04.680 --> 32:06.080
question them carefully.

32:07.280 --> 32:08.240
Lv Lun.

32:09.360 --> 32:11.480
Where is your wife, Madam Chang?

32:11.560 --> 32:12.480
She's dead.

32:13.080 --> 32:14.800
She was murdered!

32:14.880 --> 32:16.400
Wei Heng'e.

32:17.480 --> 32:18.960
Did you murder Madam Chang?

32:20.960 --> 32:22.640
I've been framed, Lady Li!

32:22.720 --> 32:25.720
That woman stole valuables
and fled the residence.

32:25.800 --> 32:28.320
She fell off a cliff.
She got what she deserved.

32:29.520 --> 32:31.080
Rao is my own niece.

32:31.680 --> 32:33.760
I'm married, and I can't inherit
my brother's family's wealth anyway.

32:33.840 --> 32:36.840
The claim that I'd harm Wei Rao
makes no sense at all.

32:37.880 --> 32:39.960
This man is treacherous and greedy.

32:40.040 --> 32:42.640
He and his wife were partners in crime.

32:42.720 --> 32:45.560
Now he's helping outsiders
falsely accuse his own masters!

32:45.640 --> 32:47.560
What could he possibly be after?

32:48.560 --> 32:51.200
Lady Li, please see the truth!

32:51.800 --> 32:54.280
Give him 40 lashes,
then question him again!

32:54.920 --> 32:57.000
-Guards!
-Mercy, Lady Li! Please!

32:57.080 --> 32:58.920
Everything I said is true!

32:59.000 --> 33:02.120
I-I wouldn't dare lie!
Mercy, Lady Li! Mercy!

33:02.200 --> 33:03.520
-You can't beat a confession out of him!
-Mercy please!

33:03.600 --> 33:05.120
You don't get to speak.

33:14.280 --> 33:16.920
I'll confess!

33:17.440 --> 33:18.680
I'll tell you everything!

33:22.360 --> 33:23.640
Lady Li,

33:24.160 --> 33:25.840
I lied.

33:25.920 --> 33:27.360
The truth is,

33:27.440 --> 33:30.080
I was acting on Noble Lady Wu'an's orders!

33:46.480 --> 33:48.040
Hurry! Faster!

33:48.760 --> 33:50.800
Mother, what message did His Lordship send

33:50.880 --> 33:52.960
that has you rushing
to Xianzhuang like this?

33:53.800 --> 33:55.800
Why not bring Sister with us?

33:56.520 --> 33:58.320
Does this concern Noble Lady Wu'an?

33:58.400 --> 34:01.400
She can't handle serious matters.
She'd only make things worse.

34:02.080 --> 34:03.080
You're levelheaded.

34:03.160 --> 34:06.400
Don't ask questions now.
You'll know when we get there.

34:09.040 --> 34:09.880
You there!

34:12.760 --> 34:14.040
What's going on?

34:14.120 --> 34:15.560
Madam, two carriages
collided at the city gate.

34:15.639 --> 34:17.040
Neither side will back down,

34:17.120 --> 34:18.159
so they've blocked the gate.

34:18.239 --> 34:19.520
Take another route. Now!

34:19.600 --> 34:21.960
Going around the west side
will be a long detour.

34:22.040 --> 34:24.080
We may not reach
the estate until the Xu hour.

34:24.719 --> 34:27.400
This is bad. Very bad.

34:28.239 --> 34:30.120
Make way for the Duke's carriage!

34:33.840 --> 34:35.760
Take the detour! Hurry!

34:37.920 --> 34:38.840
She…

34:38.920 --> 34:40.639
She gave me 200 coins

34:40.719 --> 34:43.880
and told me to make up lies
to frame Lady Heng'e!

34:43.960 --> 34:46.440
That story about bribing
the wet nurse and swapping the girl

34:46.520 --> 34:48.000
was all made up by this fraud.

34:48.080 --> 34:50.159
She even fabricated evidence
to deceive everyone!

34:50.239 --> 34:53.719
See? She even found
an identical Longevity Lock.

34:53.800 --> 34:55.520
I didn't dare do it at first.

34:55.600 --> 34:57.920
But she kept tempting me.

34:58.880 --> 35:01.760
She knew she looked
just like Lady Wei Rao,

35:01.840 --> 35:04.160
so she boldly hatched this scheme
to turn you against each other!

35:04.920 --> 35:08.240
After all, my wife is already dead,

35:08.320 --> 35:10.840
and the wet nurse and guards are dead,
leaving no witnesses.

35:10.920 --> 35:12.920
With truth and lies all mixed up,
she could easily manipulate things.

35:13.560 --> 35:15.400
If you believed even part of her story,

35:15.480 --> 35:17.160
she could make the rest look true

35:17.240 --> 35:19.160
and claim the title of Noble Lady,

35:19.240 --> 35:21.800
living in wealth and luxury forever!

35:21.880 --> 35:23.800
She even promised me
a mansion and fertile land,

35:23.880 --> 35:25.600
plus a beautiful new wife.

35:25.680 --> 35:28.600
I lost my head for a moment.
Greed blinded me.

35:28.680 --> 35:31.040
I deserve death!

35:31.120 --> 35:33.200
-You lying snake!
-I deserve death!

35:33.280 --> 35:35.840
You claimed to be
a Wei servant seeking my protection,

35:36.440 --> 35:37.560
but someone had already bought you off!

35:37.640 --> 35:38.920
You set this trap to frame me!

35:39.600 --> 35:40.560
If this Longevity Lock is fake,

35:40.640 --> 35:42.880
then the clothes, shoes,
and socks must be fake too?

35:42.960 --> 35:45.440
I was only a child.
What could I possibly have known

35:45.520 --> 35:46.880
about the personal belongings

35:46.960 --> 35:49.120
of a noble girl
from the Earl's household years ago?

35:49.200 --> 35:50.640
Even if they're all fake,

35:51.280 --> 35:53.200
why were the fleeing wet nurse and guards

35:53.280 --> 35:54.720
killed at South Mountain of all places?

35:55.480 --> 35:57.720
If that wasn't silencing witnesses,
what was it?

35:57.800 --> 36:00.080
How dare you tell such a shameless lie?

36:00.160 --> 36:02.120
Aren't you afraid of divine punishment?

36:02.200 --> 36:05.480
Lady Li, I have proof of what I said.

36:05.560 --> 36:09.240
I didn't spend a single coin
of the bribe she gave me.

36:09.320 --> 36:12.760
I buried it all outside the city,
under the old elm tree on Jiwei Slope.

36:12.840 --> 36:15.280
If you don't believe me,
send someone to dig it up.

36:20.800 --> 36:21.800
Guards.

36:22.840 --> 36:24.000
Take him to retrieve the evidence.

36:27.360 --> 36:28.320
Move!

36:29.520 --> 36:31.440
Lady Li, when the evidence was found,

36:32.040 --> 36:33.360
Lord Lu saw it himself.

36:33.440 --> 36:36.040
-He can testify for me.
-Lord Lu?

36:37.280 --> 36:40.120
You've bewitched Lord Lu so completely
he can't tell right from wrong.

36:40.200 --> 36:41.800
And you expect him to judge the truth?

36:42.960 --> 36:45.960
Child traffickers would never
leave evidence behind.

36:46.040 --> 36:48.440
They'd have burned or buried it long ago.

36:50.640 --> 36:53.560
These are all fake!

36:54.160 --> 36:56.560
Fake! Every last one is fake!

37:04.640 --> 37:07.000
The substitute bride I found back then

37:07.640 --> 37:10.280
was so greedy

37:10.360 --> 37:14.320
she spun an outrageous lie
to take Rao's place!

37:15.200 --> 37:18.280
It's my fault. As her aunt,

37:18.880 --> 37:21.880
I let a wolf into our home and harmed Rao!

37:22.440 --> 37:23.280
Lady Li,

37:23.920 --> 37:25.080
this mother and daughter

37:25.160 --> 37:28.280
conspired in secret
to impersonate a noblewoman.

37:29.200 --> 37:31.320
They must not be spared!

37:31.400 --> 37:33.600
No! I swear we didn't!

37:33.680 --> 37:35.800
I truly picked up Noble Lady Wu'an.

37:35.880 --> 37:37.080
I wouldn't dare lie.

37:39.320 --> 37:41.360
Rao isn't your biological daughter.

37:42.720 --> 37:45.640
Yet you're so eager to condemn me.

37:46.640 --> 37:48.000
What are you really after?

37:48.960 --> 37:50.480
What am I after?

37:50.560 --> 37:52.360
What could I possibly want?

37:52.440 --> 37:54.440
I only feel sorry for the poor child

37:54.520 --> 37:56.320
that my late brother left behind.

37:58.120 --> 37:59.560
Yes, pitiful indeed.

38:02.000 --> 38:04.040
My birth father died in battle

38:04.120 --> 38:06.960
and entrusted his young daughter
to his own family,

38:08.880 --> 38:09.920
hoping you

38:10.520 --> 38:12.800
would raise and cherish his precious girl.

38:12.880 --> 38:15.400
How could he know his own sister

38:15.480 --> 38:18.240
would swap two girls
for her own selfish gain?

38:18.800 --> 38:22.200
One grew up pampered in luxury,

38:22.720 --> 38:25.160
while the other lived in poverty,
driven to the brink!

38:27.040 --> 38:30.120
Wei Heng'e, ask yourself.

38:30.760 --> 38:31.720
After everything you've done,

38:31.800 --> 38:34.040
can you face
the brother who died in battle?

38:34.120 --> 38:36.640
-Can you face your own conscience?
-Shut your mouth!

38:37.240 --> 38:38.520
My conscience is clear!

38:38.600 --> 38:42.080
I did nothing! I can swear to Heaven!

38:42.160 --> 38:43.280
What would I have to fear?

38:53.080 --> 38:53.920
Bitao.

38:55.520 --> 38:58.120
You grew up in our Wei family.

38:58.200 --> 39:00.760
You were always by Lady Wei Rao's side.

39:00.840 --> 39:02.800
She cared for you more than anyone.

39:03.920 --> 39:07.240
How could you forget
all the Wei family did for you

39:07.320 --> 39:08.760
and help someone commit such evil?

39:08.840 --> 39:10.640
How could you serve an impostor?

39:11.560 --> 39:12.520
Bitao.

39:12.600 --> 39:15.920
Tell us. What do you know?

39:41.600 --> 39:42.920
It was you.

39:46.720 --> 39:48.960
You switched the Longevity Lock.

39:50.760 --> 39:51.960
Your Ladyship…

39:52.720 --> 39:53.800
I…

39:54.840 --> 39:55.680
I…

39:58.040 --> 40:00.760
Keep stalling, and you'll anger Lady Li.

40:00.840 --> 40:02.880
Then you'll be dragged out
and beaten to death!

40:02.960 --> 40:05.440
Your parents and brothers
will be punished too!

40:08.040 --> 40:09.680
You'd better tell the truth.

40:10.280 --> 40:13.120
Don't be afraid.
As long as you tell the truth,

40:13.720 --> 40:17.520
Lady Li will see that justice is done.

40:17.600 --> 40:19.680
Speak! Have you lost your voice?

40:20.200 --> 40:21.160
I said, speak!

40:45.360 --> 40:46.880
So that's how it is.

40:49.720 --> 40:52.360
From the very first day
I entered the Wei Residence,

40:53.720 --> 40:56.560
someone had already planted
a pawn by my side,

40:58.120 --> 41:00.160
waiting for this very day.

41:02.520 --> 41:05.800
I was too foolish, too naive,

41:07.200 --> 41:09.640
too desperate to find my birth mother

41:11.600 --> 41:13.840
to see the trap right in front of me.

41:21.800 --> 41:23.080
Wei Heng'e.

41:27.360 --> 41:29.040
When I disappeared back then,

41:29.600 --> 41:32.480
you must have had help
inside the residence to switch us!

41:34.720 --> 41:37.240
-Who could that have been?
-You…

41:40.280 --> 41:42.880
You certainly have a sharp tongue.

41:43.680 --> 41:44.920
You turn defense into attack

41:45.600 --> 41:47.720
and keep pressing your accusations.

41:47.800 --> 41:49.440
You have no proof,

41:49.520 --> 41:53.280
yet you twist the truth
and falsely accuse others.

41:54.440 --> 41:58.160
You're still young.
Stay on the right path.

41:58.680 --> 42:02.560
Don't make a foolish choice you'll regret.

42:03.800 --> 42:05.640
A Longevity Lock can be forged.

42:06.560 --> 42:07.760
Witnesses can be bought.

42:11.280 --> 42:12.720
It's been 16 years.

42:14.000 --> 42:15.800
Someone has deliberately interfered,

42:15.880 --> 42:17.720
trying to turn truth into lies

42:17.800 --> 42:19.680
and keep a mother and daughter apart.

42:20.240 --> 42:21.640
But I want to ask you,

42:23.480 --> 42:24.680
Lady Li.

42:27.480 --> 42:29.800
Why did you lose your own daughter?

42:30.560 --> 42:31.920
And why,

42:32.000 --> 42:35.120
when she's standing right in front of you,
do you refuse to see the truth

42:35.200 --> 42:37.920
and let them make up lies to slander her?

42:45.200 --> 42:46.280
Why?

42:56.640 --> 42:57.800
Mother!

43:14.600 --> 43:17.600
Mother, you're confused.
How can you believe a fraud?

43:17.680 --> 43:21.360
She uses sweet words
to twist right and wrong.

43:21.960 --> 43:25.080
You'll believe her,
but not your own daughter?

43:26.400 --> 43:28.320
Mother, look at me.

43:29.960 --> 43:31.320
Feel this.

43:33.360 --> 43:35.320
When you left the Wei family back then,

43:35.400 --> 43:38.000
Grandmother was grieving
Father's early death.

43:38.080 --> 43:39.560
No one in the family had time for me.

43:40.160 --> 43:43.120
I secretly slipped out,
hoping to find you at the palace.

43:43.720 --> 43:45.560
But the steps were too high.

43:45.640 --> 43:47.960
I slipped and fell.
That's how I got this scar.

43:49.560 --> 43:52.240
This scar proves
how much I missed you, Mother.

43:55.160 --> 43:56.200
Mother.

43:57.880 --> 43:59.800
Mother, are you really
going to believe her

43:59.880 --> 44:01.480
and abandon your own daughter?

44:03.120 --> 44:04.480
Does it still hurt?

44:42.120 --> 44:45.680
How did the world come to this?

44:46.440 --> 44:49.480
What is real anymore? What is false?

44:49.560 --> 44:50.560
I…

44:52.160 --> 44:53.240
Mother.

44:53.880 --> 44:57.840
We should leave this matter to Lady Li.

44:57.920 --> 45:00.360
As long as Lady Li acts decisively

45:00.440 --> 45:01.680
and puts an end to this,

45:01.760 --> 45:04.760
the Lu family will know it's settled

45:04.840 --> 45:06.520
and won't dare object.

45:06.600 --> 45:09.120
No matter how bold Lu Zhuo is,

45:09.200 --> 45:13.040
the family is still ruled
by the upright old Duke.

45:13.640 --> 45:15.200
Once it's done,

45:15.280 --> 45:17.400
the two families can settle the rest.

45:18.000 --> 45:19.720
Then everything can be covered up,

45:20.320 --> 45:22.600
without involving the Wei family.

45:23.440 --> 45:25.120
You can finally rest easy.

45:25.200 --> 45:26.600
And we can

45:27.760 --> 45:32.480
give Lady Rao's late father an answer.

45:32.560 --> 45:36.520
My only fear is that Lady Li will hesitate

45:36.600 --> 45:39.320
and go soft.

45:45.600 --> 45:46.680
Mother.

45:47.280 --> 45:49.840
The evidence is conclusive now.
She has no defense left!

45:50.600 --> 45:52.200
Will you still indulge this liar

45:52.280 --> 45:55.400
and let her humiliate me in public
and disgrace Father's name?

45:56.000 --> 45:57.840
Mother, make your decision!

46:04.960 --> 46:05.920
A-Chou.

46:07.360 --> 46:08.720
What else do you have to say?

46:09.880 --> 46:11.200
I have nothing to say.

46:14.120 --> 46:16.480
Guards! Take her…

46:20.280 --> 46:21.240
Stop!

48:32.240 --> 48:34.480
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
